## Key Design Decisions

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| **Zero dependencies** | Uses only `node:fs`, `node:path`, `node:crypto` |
| **Comparison strategy** | Quick check (size + mtime) → deep checksum only when needed |
| **Concurrency** | Worker-pool pattern bounded by `maxConcurrency` |
| **Fault tolerance** | Exponential-backoff retry with jitter; per-file error isolation |
| **Filtering** | Custom glob→RegExp engine; include overrides exclude |
| **Sync modes** | `one-way` (source→dest), `mirror` (+ delete orphans), `two-way` (bidirectional with conflict resolution) |
| **Dry-run** | Full plan is generated and logged, but no writes occur |
| **Logging** | Structured JSON logs to stdout + rotating file |
| **Timestamps** | FAT32/NFS-safe 2-second tolerance; optional preservation |
| **Large files** | Streaming checksum (64 KB chunks); configurable `maxFileSizeMB` |

